OL,5,G0100 #Text Me When You Get Home
OL,6,     FIn 2006, Elizabeth Shoaf, age 14,
OL,7,     Fwas abducted near her rural home
OL,8,     Fin South Carolina. The teenager
OL,9,     Fwas missing for over a week when a
OL,10,     Ftext message came through that
OL,11,     Foffered hope.
OL,12,G0155 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Adil Sheraz treats a bus driver
OL,14,     Fwith over 100 lipomas, Dr Toby
OL,15,     FNelson tries to help a 23-year-old
OL,16,     Fwho's covered in keloids, plus a
OL,17,     Ftreat of a cyst for Dr Emma
OL,18,     FMcMullen.
